        "explanation": "Doctor immediately requests quantitative blood pressure and evaluates the significance of 'high' in the context of diabetes, recent eye surgery, and retinal vein occlusion.",
        "quote": "**请立即再次测量血压**，休息5-10分钟后安静状态下测量，记下准确的收缩压和舒张压数值（比如“158/95 mmHg”），这非常重要。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
